SalonBookingApp-Microservices
A Java Spring Boot microservices-based application designed for managing salon bookings with a scalable, modular architecture. Each service is independently deployable and communicates via REST APIs, making the system flexible and easy to extend. Key Features User Service – Handles user registration, authentication, and profile management.

Salon Service – Manages salon details, services offered, and availability.

Booking Service – Enables customers to book appointments and track reservations.

Payment Service – Integrates secure payment processing for bookings.

Notification Service – Sends email/SMS notifications for confirmations and reminders.

Review Service – Allows customers to provide ratings and feedback.

Category & Service Offering Services – Organize salon services into categories for easy browsing.

Gateway Server – Acts as an API gateway, routing requests to appropriate services.

Eureka Server – Service discovery for dynamic scaling and load balancing.

Docker Compose – Containerized deployment for all microservices.

🛠️ Tech Stack Backend: Java, Spring Boot, Spring Cloud

Database: MySQL / PostgreSQL

Authentication: Keycloak (for role-based access control)

DevOps: Docker, Docker Compose, Jenkins, SonarQube
